{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"六年春王正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"夏，公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衛侯、曹伯伐鄭，圍新城。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"秋，楚人圍許，諸侯遂救許。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"冬，公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"六年春，晉侯使賈華伐屈。夷吾不能守，盟而行。將奔狄，郤芮曰：「後出同走，罪也。不如之梁，梁近秦而幸焉。」乃之梁。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"夏，諸侯伐鄭，以其逃首止之盟故也。圍新密，鄭所以不時城也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"秋，楚子圍許以救鄭，諸侯救許，乃還。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_69_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_69","textTraditional":"冬，蔡穆侯將許僖公以見楚子於武城。許男面縛銜璧，大夫衰絰，士輿櫬。楚子問諸逢伯，對曰：「昔武王克殷，微子啟如是。武王親釋其縛，受其璧而祓之。焚其櫬，禮而命之，使復其所。」楚子從之。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}